A task item's checkbox is not decided by its first block

```
- [ ] > q
- [x] # h
- [ ] ---
.
<ul>
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled> 
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </li>
  <li><input type="checkbox" checked disabled> 
    <h1 id="h">h</h1>
  </li>
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled> 
    <hr>
  </li>
</ul>
```
